WEBVTT

00:05:57.836 --> 00:06:01.236
The truth is that "Tierra y Libertad"
is barely hanging on ...

00:06:02.716 --> 00:06:06.156
like so many other environmental
frontline solutions

00:06:06.196 --> 00:06:09.036
that are healing and transforming
communities today ...

00:06:10.476 --> 00:06:13.276
but are overlooked and underresourced

00:06:13.316 --> 00:06:16.876
by foundations, banks
and other sources of support.

00:06:17.756 --> 00:06:19.916
Overlooked by us and many.

00:06:20.876 --> 00:06:24.236
Meanwhile, the fight
against climate change

00:06:24.276 --> 00:06:28.276
is increasingly positioned
as a big business opportunity

00:06:28.276 --> 00:06:29.436
for big business.